<p id="S1.T1.3" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S1.T1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bibx38" title="" class="ltx_ref">PR20</a><span id="S1.T1.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="S1.T1.3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> also gives a zero-free result on a part of a circle, which is not a region.</span></p></div></div>
