><mrow></mrow><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\lambda_{v}\left(\sum_{\sigma:V\backslash\{v\}\rightarrow\{+,-\}}\beta^{m^{\prime}(\sigma)+|\{w\in N(v)\mid\sigma(w)=+\}|}\prod\limits_{w\in V\backslash\{v\}\atop\sigma(w)=+}\lambda_{w}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
