<p id="S5.p11.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.p11.3.1" class="ltx_text">Clearly, <math id="S5.p11.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\lambda_{w}^{\sigma_{\Lambda}}|&gt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\lambda_{w}^{\sigma_{\Lambda}}|&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math> if <math id="S5.p11.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\lambda_{w}|&gt;\beta^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\lambda_{w}|&gt;\beta^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S5.p11.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\lambda_{w}^{\sigma_{\Lambda}}|&lt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\lambda_{w}^{\sigma_{\Lambda}}|&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math> if <math id="S5.p11.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\lambda_{w}|&lt;\beta^{-d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\lambda_{w}|&lt;\beta^{-d}</annotation></semantics></math>.
If for all <math id="S5.p11.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\in V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\in V</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S5.p11.m39" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\lambda_{v}|&gt;\beta^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\lambda_{v}|&gt;\beta^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> or <math id="S5.p11.m40" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0&lt;|\lambda_{v}|&lt;1/\beta^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0&lt;|\lambda_{v}|&lt;1/\beta^{d}</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="S5.p11.m41" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{G\backslash\Lambda}(\beta,\boldsymbol{\lambda}^{\sigma_{\Lambda}})\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">\</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝝀</mi><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi></msub></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{G\backslash\Lambda}(\beta,\boldsymbol{\lambda}^{\sigma_{\Lambda}})\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math> by Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem37" title="Theorem 37 (Lee-Yang circle theorem). ‣ 5 SSM for the ferromagnetic Ising model ‣ From Zero-Freeness to Strong Spatial Mixing viaa Christoffel-Darboux Type Identity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">37</span></a>.
Thus, <math id="S5.p11.m42" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{G}^{\sigma_{\Lambda}}(\beta,\boldsymbol{\lambda})\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝝀</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{G}^{\sigma_{\Lambda}}(\beta,\boldsymbol{\lambda})\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
